northstar.json`. Apple checks a coherent marginal financing stress only. General note schedules and report engine remain pending. G4, G5, G6. |\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md-81-| MC17 | Represent financing instruments and their economic/accounting lifecycles, particularly bonds and equity. U1, U2, D. | Specify proceeds, principal, carrying/fair values, rates, calendars, maturities, rights and share quantities; work issuance, accrual, settlement and relevant modification/conversion/default cases under declared treatments. | Partially specified and reference-checked: Chs. 8–9 distinguish principal/carrying/fair values and work ordinary and convertible bond issue, accrual, redemption/conversion, shares and funding default. Detailed modification, early repurchase and other-basis hybrid classification remain open. G4, G7. |\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md:82:| MC18 | Preserve joint conditional future outcomes, honest bounds and distinct failure/completeness states. U2, P, D. | Define result payloads and queries that retain branch/path dependence, distinguish sampled ranges from certified bounds and distinguish default from unsupported/numerically failed output without silent dropping or renormalisation. | Specified result cells, branch statuses, strict bound attainment and unresolved mass in Chs. 6, 8, 10/Core 0. Exact linear, joint-output and funding/default reference checks pass; general simulation/result-query implementation remains pending. G2, G3, G6. |\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md-83-\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md-84-## M4 — Standards, sectors and company variation\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md-85-\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md-86-| ID | Requirement and origin | Evidence needed to complete the design | Current assessment and related gaps |\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md-87-| --- | --- | --- | --- |\ndocs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md-88-| 