{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"reasoning","text":"**Narrowing historical focus**\n\nI need to concentrate on more specific local instructions rather than broad historical contexts. So, it’s important to read relevant contracts and codes to understand the mission checkpoints properly. I wonder how missing the details could impact the mission. I'll have to make sure I'm properly aligned with these instructions and clearly comprehend my focus. This approach will help me stay on track and avoid any misinterpretations."}}
