ts are prepared in accordance with years following a review of our reserving position were International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRSs). As a down on the previous year. The underwriting result before result, there are some deviations in the accounting policies claims equalisation provision decreased overal\",\ndata/financial-report-benchmark/integrity-manifest.json:7469:          \"quote\": \" 100.00 100.00 二、可转换公司债券情况 □适用 √不适用 64 / 212 2022 年年度报告 第十节 财务报告 一、审计报告 √适用 □不适用 审计报告 德师报(审)字(23)第 P03853 号 上海汽车集团股份有限公司全体股东： 一、审计意见 我们审计了上海汽车集团股份有限公司(以下简称“上汽集团”)的财务报表，包括 2022 年 12 月 31 日的合并及公司资产负债表、2022 年度的合并及公司利润表、合并及公司现金 流量表和合并及公司股东权益变动表以及相关财务报表附注(以下统称“财务报表”)。 我们认为，后附的财务报表在所有重大方面按照企业会计准则的规定编制，公允反映 了上汽集团 2022 年 12 月 31 日的合并及公司财务状况以及 2022 年度的合并及公司经营成 果和合并及公司现金流量。 二、形成审计意见的基础 我们按照中国注册会计师审计准则的规定执行了审计工作。审计报告的“注册会计师对 财务报表审计的责任”部分进一步阐述了我们在这些准则下的责任。按照中国注册会计师职 业道德守则，我们独立于上\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:2:  \"schema_version\": \"accdsl.master.catalog.v1\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:30:      \"objective\": \"Verify the frozen source release and rerun the existing bounded engineering/reference checks without replacing their historical output files.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:35:        \"Frozen release input hashes still match; independent corpus verification passes.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:37:        \"No manuscript, source corpus or historical release evidence is overwritten.\"\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:59:      \"objective\": \"Create one source-grounded work record for each accepted report, preserving version identity, basis evidence, source locations and unresolved availability/package/semantic obligations.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:96:        \"All 13 annual and 10 interim notes have source anchors, linked quantities or explicit unresolved meaning, with no claim that dispositions alone close semantics.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:105:      \"id\": \"P03\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:125:      \"objective\": \"Implement executable DSL source-to-IR lowering and an equivalent typed-library entrypoint for the declared Core 0 supported profile. Start with borrowing.acc and expand beyond an exact fixture lookup. Preserve package bindings, source context, assumptions and alternatives. Never label a JSON/schema parser as a semantic compiler.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:132:        \"Equivalent typed-library programs have matching semantics and changed valid inputs produce changed results rather than returning a frozen fixture.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:133:        \"Independent source variants and schema-valid negative programs test supported coverage and unsupported-operation errors.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:136:      \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p03.py\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:137:      \"output_dir\": \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P03\"\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:144:        \"P03\"\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:161:      \"objective\": \"Implement declared-template joint constraint construction and bounded rational/finite-choice reconstruction. Preserve linked alternatives, rounding, integer cases, strict endpoint attainment, infeasibility/unknown/resource limits and model scope. Use exact known-history fixtures and independent oracles.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:168:        \"Rounding, strict endpoints, integer restrictions, contradictory evidence and unsupported operations have tested semantics.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:180:        \"P03\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:204:        \"Run actual event inputs, not the expected-result fixture; independently check journals and all statement bridges.\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:207:        \"Real-company conditional calculations and any unresolved operation remain distinct from forecast accuracy and semantic completeness.\"\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:217:        \"P03\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:321:        \"P03\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:353:        \"P03\",\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:386:        \"P03\"\nscripts/accounting_master_catalog.json:405:        \"Matched frontend semantic tests share the same model, accounting methods and runtime.\",\ntests/__pycache__/test_accounting_master.cpython-311.pyc\ntests/test_accounting_master.py\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
